OL,3,APressure mounts on Congress to act on
OL,4,AAI as UK warns of 'huge risk' without
OL,5,Asafety measures
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump is downplaying AI concerns
OL,8,Fas pressure mounts on the US Congress
OL,9,Fto rein in big tech companies
OL,11,FThe president says claims that AI will
OL,12,Ftake over the world are a "hoax" and
OL,13,Fhas criticised the head of Anthropic,
OL,14,Fwho is calling for a slowdown in AI
OL,15,Fdevelopment
OL,17,FElsewhere, the UK government is heeding
OL,18,Fwarnings from tech bosses, as First
OL,19,FSecretary Louise Haigh says the
OL,20,Ftechnology poses "huge risks" if not
OL,21,Fproperly regulated
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
