OL,3,APressure mounts on Congress to act on
OL,4,AAI as UK warns of 'huge risk' without
OL,5,Asafety measures
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt all comes one day after an Anthropic
OL,8,Fexecutive told the BBC that AI is
OL,9,Fgetting more powerful "by the day" and
OL,10,Fa kill switch should be mandatory
OL,12,FStarting soon: Bernie Sanders, an
OL,13,Findependent senator, and Steve Bannon,
OL,14,Fa former Trump White House adviser, are
OL,15,Fappearing at an event in Washington to
OL,16,Fpush for AI regulations - watch live
OL,17,Fabove
OL,19,FAnd then: Top AI bosses will speak
OL,20,Fpublicly for the first time since the
OL,21,FAI slowdown debate emerged this week
